   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Plural rules",
     "md": "Most nouns just add **s**: *book - books*. Nouns ending in **s, x, ch, sh** add **es**: *box - boxes, church - churches, dish - dishes*. Nouns ending in **consonant + y** change **y to ies**: *city - cities, baby - babies*. After a vowel just add **s**: *boy - boys, day - days*. Some end in **f / fe** and change to **ves**: *leaf - leaves, knife - knives*."
    },
