     "type": "key",
     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Homophones",
     "md": "**Homophones** sound the same but have different spellings and meanings: **to / too / two**, **there / their**, **see / sea**, **write / right**, **buy / by**, **no / know**. Look at the sentence to choose: *I **see** the **sea**.* *Ako has **two** books **too**.*"
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "pieges",
     "title": "Common mistakes",
     "md": "- Using *their* for place: *Put the box over **there**.*\n- Using *too* for *to*: *She went **to** Buea* (not *too*).\n- Thinking synonyms are exactly the same: *tiny* is much smaller than *small*.\n- Not checking a new word in a dictionary."
    },
